#: includes/admin/views/settings-general.php:19
msgid "The primary connection is used for all emails unless a Smart Routing rule picks another connection."
msgstr "Die primäre Verbindung wird für alle E-Mails verwendet, sofern keine Smart-Routing-Regel eine andere Verbindung wählt."

#: includes/admin/views/settings-general.php:26
msgid "Send a test email"
msgstr "Test-E-Mail senden"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-logs.php:23
msgid "Enable the email log"
msgstr "E-Mail-Protokoll aktivieren"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-logs.php:24
msgid "Keeps a record of every email: recipients, subject, status, connection, initiator and error messages."
msgstr "Protokolliert jede E-Mail: Empfänger, Betreff, Status, Verbindung, Auslöser und Fehlermeldungen."

#: includes/admin/views/settings-logs.php:28
msgid "Log Email Content"
msgstr "E-Mail-Inhalt protokollieren"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-logs.php:30
msgid "Store the message body and headers"
msgstr "Nachrichtentext und Header speichern"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-logs.php:31
msgid "Required to view and resend emails. Emails can contain personal data or password reset links, so only enable this if you need it."
msgstr "Erforderlich zum Ansehen und erneuten Senden. E-Mails können personenbezogene Daten oder Links zum Zurücksetzen von Passwörtern enthalten – nur bei Bedarf aktivieren."

#: includes/admin/views/settings-logs.php:35
msgid "Log Retention"
msgstr "Aufbewahrungsdauer"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-logs.php:40
msgid "Forever"
msgstr "Unbegrenzt"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-logs.php:41
msgid "1 day"
msgstr "1 Tag"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-logs.php:42
msgid "1 week"
msgstr "1 Woche"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-logs.php:43
msgid "1 month"
msgstr "1 Monat"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-logs.php:44
msgid "3 months"
msgstr "3 Monate"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-logs.php:45
msgid "6 months"
msgstr "6 Monate"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-logs.php:46
msgid "1 year"
msgstr "1 Jahr"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-logs.php:52
msgid "Older log entries are deleted automatically once a day."
msgstr "Ältere Protokolleinträge werden einmal täglich automatisch gelöscht."

#: includes/admin/views/settings-misc.php:22
msgid "Domain Check"
msgstr "Domain-Prüfung"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-misc.php:24
msgid "Enable domain check"
msgstr "Domain-Prüfung aktivieren"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-misc.php:25
msgid "Only use the SMTP settings when the site runs on one of the allowed domains. Useful for staging copies or migrated sites."
msgstr "SMTP-Einstellungen nur verwenden, wenn die Website auf einer der erlaubten Domains läuft. Nützlich für Staging-Kopien oder umgezogene Websites."

#: includes/admin/views/settings-misc.php:29
msgid "Allowed domains (comma separated)"
msgstr "Erlaubte Domains (kommagetrennt)"

#. translators: %s: site domain
#: includes/admin/views/settings-misc.php:37
#, php-format
msgid "Current site domain: %s"
msgstr "Aktuelle Domain der Website: %s"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-misc.php:43
msgid "Block all emails when the domain does not match"
msgstr "Alle E-Mails blockieren, wenn die Domain nicht passt"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-misc.php:44
msgid "Without this option, emails are sent with the default PHP mailer instead of SMTP on non-matching domains."
msgstr "Ohne diese Option werden E-Mails auf nicht passenden Domains mit dem Standard-PHP-Mailer statt über SMTP gesendet."

#: includes/admin/views/settings-misc.php:50
msgid "Do Not Send"
msgstr "Nicht senden"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-misc.php:52
msgid "Stop sending all emails"
msgstr "Versand aller E-Mails stoppen"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-misc.php:53
msgid "No emails are sent from this site. Blocked emails still appear in the email log. Useful for development and staging sites."
msgstr "Diese Website versendet keine E-Mails. Blockierte E-Mails erscheinen weiterhin im E-Mail-Protokoll. Nützlich für Entwicklungs- und Staging-Seiten."

#: includes/admin/views/settings-misc.php:57
msgid "Allow Insecure SSL Certificates"
msgstr "Unsichere SSL-Zertifikate erlauben"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-misc.php:59
msgid "Allow self-signed or invalid SSL certificates"
msgstr "Selbstsignierte oder ungültige SSL-Zertifikate erlauben"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-misc.php:60
msgid "Disables certificate verification for the SMTP connection. Only enable this if your server uses a self-signed certificate — it makes the connection vulnerable to interception."
msgstr "Deaktiviert die Zertifikatsprüfung der SMTP-Verbindung. Nur aktivieren, wenn dein Server ein selbstsigniertes Zertifikat nutzt – die Verbindung wird dadurch anfällig für Abhören."

#: includes/admin/views/settings-misc.php:64
#: includes/admin/views/tools.php:80
msgid "Debug Log"
msgstr "Debug-Log"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-misc.php:66
msgid "Enable debug log"
msgstr "Debug-Log aktivieren"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-misc.php:68
msgid "Records the SMTP conversation of every email (credentials are masked). Errors are always recorded."
msgstr "Zeichnet die SMTP-Kommunikation jeder E-Mail auf (Zugangsdaten werden maskiert). Fehler werden immer aufgezeichnet."

#: includes/admin/views/settings-misc.php:69
msgid "View debug log"
msgstr "Debug-Log ansehen"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-misc.php:74
msgid "Optimize Email Sending"
msgstr "E-Mail-Versand optimieren"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-misc.php:76
msgid "Send emails in the background"
msgstr "E-Mails im Hintergrund senden"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-misc.php:77
msgid "Emails are queued and sent asynchronously via Action Scheduler, so pages that send emails load faster."
msgstr "E-Mails werden in eine Warteschlange gestellt und asynchron über den Action Scheduler gesendet, sodass Seiten, die E-Mails versenden, schneller laden."

#. translators: %d: number of emails
#: includes/admin/views/settings-misc.php:84
#, php-format
msgid "%d email is waiting in the queue."
msgid_plural "%d emails are waiting in the queue."
msgstr[0] "%d E-Mail wartet in der Warteschlange."
msgstr[1] "%d E-Mails warten in der Warteschlange."

#: includes/admin/views/settings-misc.php:89
msgid "Process queue now"
msgstr "Warteschlange jetzt abarbeiten"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-misc.php:95
msgid "Email Rate Limiting"
msgstr "E-Mail-Ratenbegrenzung"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-misc.php:97
msgid "Limit the number of emails sent"
msgstr "Anzahl gesendeter E-Mails begrenzen"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-misc.php:98
msgid "Emails above the limit stay in the queue and are sent as soon as the limit allows. Leave a field empty or 0 for no limit."
msgstr "E-Mails über dem Limit bleiben in der Warteschlange und werden gesendet, sobald das Limit es zulässt. Feld leer oder 0 lassen für kein Limit."

#: includes/admin/views/settings-misc.php:103
msgid "Per minute"
msgstr "Pro Minute"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-misc.php:104
msgid "Per hour"
msgstr "Pro Stunde"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-misc.php:105
msgid "Per day"
msgstr "Pro Tag"

#: includes/admin/views/settings-misc.php:106
msgid "Per week"
msgstr "Pro Woche"

