#. Description of the plugin
#: relaymint.php
msgid "Reliable email delivery for WordPress via SMTP or Microsoft 365 / Outlook, with email logging, smart routing, background sending and rate limiting."
msgstr "Zuverlässiger E-Mail-Versand für WordPress per SMTP oder Microsoft 365 / Outlook, mit E-Mail-Protokoll, Smart Routing, Versand im Hintergrund und Ratenbegrenzung."

#: includes/admin/class-relaymint-admin.php:493
msgid "Click \"Connect with Microsoft\" to sign in with the mailbox. Emails are not sent via Microsoft until the connection is authorized."
msgstr "Klicke auf „Mit Microsoft verbinden“, um dich mit dem Postfach anzumelden. Bis die Verbindung autorisiert ist, werden keine E-Mails über Microsoft versendet."

#: includes/admin/class-relaymint-admin.php:506
msgid "Save the Microsoft client ID and client secret first."
msgstr "Speichere zuerst die Microsoft-Client-ID und den geheimen Clientschlüssel."

#. translators: %s: error message from Microsoft
#: includes/admin/class-relaymint-admin.php:540
#, php-format
msgid "Microsoft sign-in was not completed: %s"
msgstr "Die Microsoft-Anmeldung wurde nicht abgeschlossen: %s"

#: includes/admin/class-relaymint-admin.php:545
msgid "Microsoft did not return an authorization code."
msgstr "Microsoft hat keinen Autorisierungscode zurückgegeben."

#: includes/admin/class-relaymint-admin.php:550
msgid "Microsoft account connected. Send a test email to verify the connection."
msgstr "Microsoft-Konto verbunden. Sende eine Test-E-Mail, um die Verbindung zu prüfen."

#: includes/admin/class-relaymint-admin.php:563
msgid "Microsoft account disconnected."
msgstr "Microsoft-Konto getrennt."

#: includes/admin/views/connection-fields-microsoft.php:26
#: includes/class-relaymint-connections.php:49
#: includes/class-relaymint-connections.php:191
msgid "Microsoft 365 / Outlook"
msgstr "Microsoft 365 / Outlook"

#: includes/admin/views/connection-fields-microsoft.php:28
msgid "Register an app in the Microsoft Entra admin center (App registrations), add the redirect URI below as platform \"Web\", create a client secret and grant the Microsoft Graph permission Mail.Send."
msgstr "Registriere eine App im Microsoft Entra Admin Center (App-Registrierungen), füge die folgende Umleitungs-URI als Plattform „Web“ hinzu, erstelle einen geheimen Clientschlüssel und erteile die Microsoft-Graph-Berechtigung Mail.Send."

#: includes/admin/views/connection-fields-microsoft.php:32
msgid "Redirect URI"
msgstr "Umleitungs-URI"

#: includes/admin/views/connection-fields-microsoft.php:36
msgid "Microsoft only accepts HTTPS redirect URIs (except for localhost). Enable HTTPS for the WordPress admin to sign in."
msgstr "Microsoft akzeptiert nur HTTPS-Umleitungs-URIs (außer für localhost). Aktiviere HTTPS für den WordPress-Adminbereich, um dich anzumelden."

#: includes/admin/views/connection-fields-microsoft.php:38
msgid "Only needed for \"Sign in with the mailbox\"."
msgstr "Nur für „Mit dem Postfach anmelden“ erforderlich."

#: includes/admin/views/connection-fields-microsoft.php:46
msgid "Sign in with the mailbox (delegated permission)"
msgstr "Mit dem Postfach anmelden (delegierte Berechtigung)"

#: includes/admin/views/connection-fields-microsoft.php:47
msgid "Works with Microsoft 365 work or school accounts and personal Outlook.com accounts. Required permissions: Mail.Send, User.Read and offline_access (delegated)."
msgstr "Funktioniert mit Microsoft-365-Geschäfts- oder Schulkonten und privaten Outlook.com-Konten. Benötigte Berechtigungen: Mail.Send, User.Read und offline_access (delegiert)."

#: includes/admin/views/connection-fields-microsoft.php:48
msgid "App-only (application permission)"
msgstr "Nur App (Anwendungsberechtigung)"

#: includes/admin/views/connection-fields-microsoft.php:49
msgid "Microsoft 365 only, no sign-in needed. Required permission: Mail.Send (application) with admin consent. Emails are sent from the From Email mailbox; restrict the app with an Exchange application access policy."
msgstr "Nur Microsoft 365, keine Anmeldung nötig. Benötigte Berechtigung: Mail.Send (Anwendung) mit Administratorzustimmung. E-Mails werden aus dem Postfach der Absender-E-Mail versendet; schränke die App mit einer Exchange-Anwendungszugriffsrichtlinie ein."

#: includes/admin/views/connection-fields-microsoft.php:54
msgid "Directory (tenant) ID"
msgstr "Verzeichnis-ID (Mandant)"

#: includes/admin/views/connection-fields-microsoft.php:58
msgid "Tenant ID or domain (e.g. contoso.onmicrosoft.com). For \"Sign in with the mailbox\" you can also use \"common\" (any account), \"organizations\" or \"consumers\" (Outlook.com). App-only requires your tenant ID."
msgstr "Mandanten-ID oder Domain (z. B. contoso.onmicrosoft.com). Für „Mit dem Postfach anmelden“ sind auch „common“ (beliebiges Konto), „organizations“ oder „consumers“ (Outlook.com) möglich. „Nur App“ erfordert deine Mandanten-ID."

#: includes/admin/views/connection-fields-microsoft.php:62
msgid "Application (client) ID"
msgstr "Anwendungs-ID (Client)"

#: includes/admin/views/connection-fields-microsoft.php:69
msgid "Client Secret"
msgstr "Geheimer Clientschlüssel"

#: includes/admin/views/connection-fields-microsoft.php:76
msgid "The secret value (not the secret ID). Client secrets expire; create a new one in time."
msgstr "Der Wert des Geheimnisses (nicht die Geheimnis-ID). Geheime Clientschlüssel laufen ab; erstelle rechtzeitig einen neuen."

#: includes/admin/views/connection-fields-microsoft.php:78
msgid "A client secret is stored (encrypted). Leave empty to keep it."
msgstr "Ein geheimer Clientschlüssel ist (verschlüsselt) gespeichert. Leer lassen, um ihn zu behalten."

#: includes/admin/views/connection-fields-microsoft.php:79
msgid "Remove the stored client secret"
msgstr "Gespeicherten geheimen Clientschlüssel entfernen"

#. translators: %s: constant name
#: includes/admin/views/connection-fields-microsoft.php:87
#, php-format
msgid "Tip: define %s in wp-config.php to keep the client secret out of the database."
msgstr "Tipp: Definiere %s in der wp-config.php, damit der geheime Clientschlüssel nicht in der Datenbank liegt."

#: includes/admin/views/connection-fields-microsoft.php:98
msgid "Microsoft Account"
msgstr "Microsoft-Konto"

#: includes/admin/views/connection-fields-microsoft.php:101
msgid "Save the connection first, then sign in with the mailbox."
msgstr "Speichere zuerst die Verbindung und melde dich dann mit dem Postfach an."

#: includes/admin/views/connection-fields-microsoft.php:107
msgid "Connected"
msgstr "Verbunden"

#: includes/admin/views/connection-fields-microsoft.php:111
msgid "Reconnect"
msgstr "Erneut verbinden"

#: includes/admin/views/connection-fields-microsoft.php:112
msgid "Disconnect"
msgstr "Trennen"

#: includes/admin/views/connection-fields-microsoft.php:115
msgid "Not connected"
msgstr "Nicht verbunden"

#: includes/admin/views/connection-fields-microsoft.php:117
msgid "Connect with Microsoft"
msgstr "Mit Microsoft verbinden"

#: includes/admin/views/connection-fields-microsoft.php:119
msgid "Select Microsoft 365 / Outlook, enter the client ID and secret and save the connection, then sign in with the mailbox."
msgstr "Wähle Microsoft 365 / Outlook, trage Client-ID und geheimen Clientschlüssel ein und speichere die Verbindung; melde dich dann mit dem Postfach an."

#: includes/admin/views/connection-fields-microsoft.php:122
msgid "Save your changes before connecting. Leave the From Email empty to send as the signed-in mailbox; other addresses need \"Send As\" permission in Exchange."
msgstr "Speichere deine Änderungen vor dem Verbinden. Lass die Absender-E-Mail leer, um als angemeldetes Postfach zu senden; andere Adressen benötigen die Berechtigung „Senden als“ in Exchange."

#: includes/admin/views/connection-fields.php:32
msgid "Mailer"
msgstr "Versandart"

#: includes/admin/views/connection-fields.php:43
msgid "SMTP works with any provider. Microsoft 365 / Outlook sends through the Microsoft Graph API with OAuth 2.0 and does not need SMTP AUTH or a mailbox password."
msgstr "SMTP funktioniert mit jedem Anbieter. Microsoft 365 / Outlook sendet über die Microsoft Graph API mit OAuth 2.0 und benötigt weder SMTP AUTH noch ein Postfach-Passwort."

#: includes/admin/views/settings-connections.php:48
msgid "Additional connections can be used by Smart Routing to send specific emails through a different SMTP account or Microsoft 365 / Outlook mailbox."
msgstr "Zusätzliche Verbindungen können von Smart Routing genutzt werden, um bestimmte E-Mails über ein anderes SMTP-Konto oder Microsoft-365-/Outlook-Postfach zu versenden."

#: includes/admin/views/settings-connections.php:56
msgid "Sent via"
msgstr "Versand über"

